  {
    "@id": "https://www.centrekabir.com/temporary/18074ea4-bcf1-4c44-a966-8456ff34346b",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.centrekabir.com/en/events/un-spectacle-de-danse-bollywoodien/var/ri-0.l-L2"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\nTO EMBELLISH THE CLOSING EVENT"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKABIR CENTRE IS PLEASED TO COLLABORATE WITH FESTIVAL ACCÈS ASIE\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTO EMBELLISH THE CLOSING EVENT OF THEIR 27TH EDITION WITH\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tA BOLLYWOOD DANCE SHOW FOLLOWED BY A WORKSHOP BY\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAMRITA CHOUDHURY\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDancer, Teacher, Choreographer\n&\nA cultural cornerstone of our vibrant city\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tThrough lovely rhythms, hand gestures and body movements, the Bollywood dance form transports us to a state of exuberance. The show will be followed by workshop for the public where everyone can take part. No experience is necessary but a smile, a warm heart and readiness to dance will add to your joy and that of others!\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSunday 29th May at 2 PM\nParc Lahaie, corner of Boul. St. Laurent & Boul. St. Joseph East\nADMISSION: FREE\n\n\t\t \n\t \n"
      }
    ],
