    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr-fr",
        "@value": "The Kabir Center is proud to present the sounds of the Santoor in an enchanting concert of Hindustani music with renowned musicians Padmashri Pandit Satish Vyas & Mukundraj Deo (Mumbai, India) accompanied by virtuosos Canadians Jonathan Voyer & Shawn Mativetsky. [/ vc_column_text] [/ vc_column] [/..."
