      },
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t \n\t  The Kabir Center is proud to present the sounds of the Santoor in an enchanting concert of Hindustani music with renowned musicians Padmashri Pandit Satish Vyas & Mukundraj Deo (Mumbai, India) accompanied by virtuosos Canadians Jonathan Voyer & Shawn Mativetsky. [/ vc_column_text] [/ vc_column] [/ vc_row]\n"
      }
