        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Kabir Centre is proud to present, in collaboration with La maison de la culture Ahuntsic, the emerging dancers from Quebec. Here are the events of the day.   The divine feminine:  by Natya Collective (Surya, Arushi et Aishwarya, étudiantes de l’Université McGill). This event, in..."
