        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "FESTIVAL NEXGEN MULTIARTS 7th Edition - Music Day - Le Centre Kabir pour les Arts & la Culture"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Kabir Centre is proud to present, in collaboration with La maison de la culture Ahuntsic emerging musicians from Quebec/Canada. The following events are proposed. 1. Portraits of Devi (female deity) by Arjun Ashok (vocal) – Anjana Srinivasan (Violin) – Sainan Kandiah (Mridangam) – Kajanan Shanmugarajah..."
      }
    ],
