      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKABIR CENTRE IS PROUD TO PRESENT\n\nSAROD SUBLIME\nAN INDIAN CLASSICAL MUSIC CONCERT\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tArtists\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTroilee Dutta – Sarod\nMoisilee Dutta – Sarod\nIndranil Mallick – Tabla\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDate :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tHeure:\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tLieu:\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSunday 18 May 2025\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2:30 PM\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tChapelle Saint-Cyriac\n5621 Rue de la chapelle\nLac Kénogami, QC G7X 0H9\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAdmission :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tthepointofsale.com\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\n"
