      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKABIR CULTURAL CENTRE, IN COLLABORATION WITH\nLE FESTIVAL ACCES ASIE\nIS PROUD TO PRESENT\n\nSAROD SUBLIME\n A SUPERB INDIAN CLASSICAL MUSIC CONCERT\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tArtists\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTroilee Dutta – Sarod\nMoisilee Dutta – Sarod\nIndranil Mallick – Tabla\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDate :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tHeure:\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tLieu:\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tFriday 16 May 2025\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t8:00 PM\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tLe Gesù\n1200 Rue de Bleury\nMontreal, QC H3B 3J3\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAdmission :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tlegesu.tuxedobillet.com\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\n"
