      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKABIR CENTRE IS PROUD TO PRESENT\n\nSAROD SUBLIME\nAN INDIAN CLASSICAL MUSIC CONCERT\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tArtists\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTroilee Dutta – Sarod\nMoisilee Dutta – Sarod\nIndranil Mallick – Tabla\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDate :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tHeure:\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tLieu:\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tThursday 15 May 2025\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t8:00 PM\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tLa Caravane\n4500 Chemin Capelton\nNorth Hatley, QC J0B2C0\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAdmission :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tthepointofsale.com\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\n"
