  {
    "@id": "https://www.centrekabir.com/temporary/c3797132-8608-45c3-84ec-584c68ed7234",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.centrekabir.com/en/events/echos-du-coeur-quebec/var/ri-0.l-L2"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Allow yourself to be swept"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKABIR CULTURAL CENTRE IS PLEASED TO PRESENT\nECHOES OF THE HEART\nHarmonies of the Sarod & the Tabla\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAllow yourself to be swept away by the enchanting melodies of Abhishek Lahiri on the sarod and the pulsating rhythms of Indranil Mallick on the tabla. Don’t miss this unique event that celebrates the best of Indian classical music, a true ode to artistic emotion capturing the essence and soul of India, a country with a rich heritage and captivating traditions.\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tArtists\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSarod: Abhisek Lahiri\nTabla: Indranil Mallick\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDate :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTime :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tVenue :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSaturday April 27, 2024\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t7:30 pm\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSalle de concert de l’Arquemuse\n151-A, rue Saint-François Est, Québec\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTickets :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tlepointdevente.com\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\n"
      }
    ],
