        "@value": "\nDancers : Anita Pandey - Anuj Mishra - Ayan Banerjee - Gouri"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tARTISTS\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDancers : Anita Pandey – Anuj Mishra – Ayan Banerjee – Gouri Kundu – Nandini Sharma – Souvik Chakraborty\nMusicians : Deepak Paramashivan — Varijashree Venugopal\nMusic Composer, Vocal & Instrumental : Praveen D. Rao\nLighting: Douglas MacDonald\nArtistic Direction, Choreography, Concept and Vocal : USHA GUPTA\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDATE:\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTime:\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tVenue:\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSaturday 12 Aug 2023\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t8:00 pm\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMaison de la culture Ahuntsic\n10300 Rue Lajeunesse, Montréal, QC H3L 2E5\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTickets :\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tthepointofsale.com\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\n"
      }
