    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\nis pleased to collaborate with École de musique Arquemuse\nin presenting a concert of"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKabir Cultural Centre is proud to\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tis pleased to collaborate with École de musique Arquemuse\nin presenting a concert of South Asian classical music\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSONIC LANDSCAPES WITH SERENE SURBAHAR\nBY\nMAESTRO USTAD IRSHAD KHAN\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tIrshad Khan is the leading Surbahar player of this generation.\nSee video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kThoPthWgm0\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tHe will be accompanied on tabla by Zaheer-Abbas Janmohamed, a rising and charismatic star of percussion.\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tFriday 22 April, 8 pm\nSalle de concert de l’Arquemuse\n151-A, rue Saint-François Est, Québec\nTickets : lepointdevente.com\nInfo : 514 926 4182\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t \n\t \n"
      }
