  {
    "@id": "https://www.centrekabir.com/temporary/e5e99e28-560d-4627-8878-ff3febe1045a",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.centrekabir.com/en/events/ecstasy-of-indian-violin/var/ri-0.l-L2"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\nCANCELLED due to evolving Covid-19 situation.\n\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\nL. SUBRAMANIAM is an acclaimed Indian violinist, composer and conductor, trained in the classical Carnatic music tradition and Western classical music. Constantly propelled from Singapore to Paris, from Delhi to Los Angeles, he has conquered every audience with the elegance and virtuosity of his style. His career as a childhood prodigy brought him into contact with the greatest musicians. At a very young age, he was honoured with the title “Violin Chakravarthy” (Emperor of the violin). His breadth of musicianship was put on displayed throughout his performing career and has featured collaborations with a variety of artists including George Harrison and Ravi Shankar (with whom he toured the U.S. and Canada). He has amassed over 200 recordings to his name and has performed with Ruggiero Ricci, Herbie Hancock, Joe Sample, Jean-Luc Ponty, Stanley Clarke John Handy. He will be accompanied in this concert by the highly talented ANINDO CHATTERJEE on tabla and MAHESH KRISHNAMURTHY on mridangam.\n“L. Subramaniam, one of the greatest exponents of Indian violin, is passing through Quebec. His great virtuosity and the amazing ambiance he is capable of building up will transport you on a journey filled with serenity. A rendez-vous with this unique and exceptional musician is not to be missed.’’ – Angèle Dubeau\n\n\t\t \n\t \t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\t \n\t \n"
      }
    ],
