        "@value": "Kabir Centre is proud to present the sounds of Santoor in an enchanting music concert by the distinguished maestros Padmashri"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tKabir Centre is proud to present the sounds of Santoor in an enchanting music concert by the distinguished maestros Padmashri Pandit Satish Vyas & Mukundraj Deo from Mumbai, India accompanied by the Canadian virtuosos Jonathan Voyer & Shawn Mativetsky.\n\n\t\t \n\t \n"
      }
