    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Please come and listen to these delightful emerging Canadian talent in performing South Asian Arts: Carnatic Music, Kathak Dance, Hindustani"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tPlease come and listen to these delightful emerging Canadian talent in performing South Asian Arts: Carnatic Music, Kathak Dance, Hindustani Music and Odissi Dance\nFive mini-concerts from 2 pm to 8:30 pm, bringing you the warmth of a true Indian Summer!!!\n\n\t\t \n\t \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tADMISSION AND SNACKS FREE; DONATIONS WELCOME!\n\n\t\t \n\t \n"
